    "description": "# BA-8: Assigned Deals Related List\n\n_Deals this BA is tied to._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Deals this BA is tied to, with market, vertical, and deal status\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Not confirmed in the transcript\n\n* Sourced from the prototype only.\n\n* Market, Vertical, and Deal Status need cross-reference formula fields before they can be added as columns\n\n* These fields live on Deal, not on the Deal Rep Assignment junction object, so they don't show up as selectable columns on this related list as-is. Kobi confirmed the fix: create formula fields on Deal Rep Assignment that reach across to the related Deal record. See [BUILD-237 — Deal Rep Assignment: Deal Cross-Reference Formula Fields](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217841280295352/f/).\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: BA-8 (Brand Ambassador Record User Stories doc).\n* Depends on the Deal object existing — no Asana ticket for it yet.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc BA-8 — Brand Ambassador Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.g64hrhse8pog)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-202 — Brand Ambassador: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693577680227/f/), [BUILD-237 — Deal Rep Assignment: Deal Cross-Reference Formula Fields](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217841280295352/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Brand Ambassador record documentation review.\n\n",
